-3</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-LoD-p66-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-LoD-p66_5-0\">5.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-LoD-p66_5-1\">5.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-LoD-p66_5-2\">5.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-LoD-p66_5-3\">5.3</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-LoD-p66_5-4\">5.4</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Carl\" title=\"Jason Carl\">Jason Carl</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sean_K._Reynolds\" title=\"Sean K. Reynolds\">Sean K. Reynolds</a>&#160;(October 2001). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Lords_of_Darkness\" title=\"Lords of Darkness\">Lords of Darkness</a></i>. Edited by <a href=\"/wiki/Michele_Carter\" title=\"Michele Carter\">Michele Carter</a>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 66. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/07-8691-989-2\" title=\"Special:BookSources/07-8691-989-2\">07-8691-989-2</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-FRCS1e-CR-p70-6\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS1e-CR-p70_6-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Jeff_Grubb\" title=\"Jeff Grubb\">Jeff Grubb</a>&#160;(August 1987). “Cyclopedia of the Realms”. In <a href=\"/wiki/Karen_S._Martin\" title=\"Karen S. Martin\">Karen S. Martin</a>&#160;ed. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Forgotten_Realms_Campaign_Set\" title=\"Forgotten Realms Campaign Set\">Forgotten Realms Campaign Set</a></i> (<a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc.\" title=\"TSR, Inc.\">TSR, Inc.</a>), p. 70. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-88038-472-7\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-88038-472-7\">0-88038-472-7</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-FRCG-p104-7\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCG-p104_7-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bruce_R._Cordell\" title=\"Bruce R. Cordell\">Bruce R. Cordell</a>, <a href=\